 Series, which is focused on highlighting rising vocalists/rappers we're going to be working with.\n\nAs smooth as they are soulful, LA-based group Hablot Brown gives us 5 original tracks that will grab you by the heartstrings. From the vocals to guitar-infused production, the first ever Black Label release will make it hard for you to not follow their journey.\n\nDiscover:<br>\n[soundcloud.com/hablotbrown](https://soundcloud.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[twitter.com/hablotbrown](https://twitter.com/hablotbrown)<br>\n[instagram.com/hablotbrown/](https://instagram.com/hablotbrown/)\n\n### Credits\n\nReleased July 29th, 2018\nMixed & Mastered by Joshua Pleeter & Austin Brown\nArtwork: Andre Power\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7226,"location":"JP","published_at":"2018-07-28T11:57:25+00:00"},"title":"Yukibeb Set","position":1}},{"id":"3QhVIvExK6k","position":25,"timestamp":"01:10:18","rawTrack":"Bobby V - Slow Down (12\" Version)","track":{"id":"KQ3YC6rtBTA","path":"/artists/bobby-v/tracks/slow-down-12-version/","slug":"slow-down-12-version","title":"Slow Down (12\" Version)","artist":{"slug":"bobby-v","title":"Bobby V"},"artwork":"images/artists/bobby-v/tracks/slow-down-12-version.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"3xkQTCdFqKA","slug":"393","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/station/episode-393/ra.1451429387","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/show-393"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #393","artwork":"images/episodes/393.jpg","content":"Bringing people together through music. Join the experience.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-02-02T13:48:17+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"ouh-D5gkV_4","position":12,"timestamp":"00:28:27","rawTrack":"Bobby V - Slow Down (12\" Version)","track":{"id":"KQ3YC6rtBTA","path":"/artists/bobby-v/tracks/slow-down-12-version/","slug":"slow-down-12-version","title":"Slow Down (12\" Version)","